      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DALAIR MILO (1) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 20.03. Well suited by the inside box and has a good record over this journey. Hard to go past. BLOCKER'S MATE (3) has missed the placings at his last couple but was in the money three back when third (19.95) at this track in a Maiden. Expected to bounce back to best. TILLY CARGO (7) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish second (20.22) at this track in a Maiden over 340m. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Expected to be in this for a long way. RUTLAND ON FIRE (5) missed the placings here on debut but looks an improver who can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
